// The mutual non-disclosure agreement of Tidewater Robotics and Juniper Analytics (nda.md).
Document "nda.md"

Fact party Identified by Tidewater, Juniper
Placeholder discloser For party
Placeholder recipient For party
Fact item
Fact purpose Identified by ConsideringTheVenture, AnythingElse
Param term : Duration = 1095

// 1. Handing over, and 4. the three years that run from it
Fact knew Identified by recipient * item
Event learns-elsewhere Related to recipient, item Creates knew()
Fact handed-over Identified by discloser * recipient * item
Fact in-term Identified by discloser * recipient * item
Fact already-known Identified by discloser * recipient * item
Act hand-over Actor discloser Recipient recipient Related to item
  Holds when discloser != recipient
  Creates handed-over(), in-term() For term, already-known() When knew()

// 3.1 What the secrecy and use clauses do not apply to
Fact public Identified by item
Event publication Related to item Creates public()
Fact developed Identified by recipient * item
Event independent-development Related to recipient, item Creates developed()
Fact confidential Identified by discloser * recipient * item
  Default handed-over-in-confidence Holds when in-term()
  Exception public-information Overrides handed-over-in-confidence Rejects when public()
  Exception known-before Overrides handed-over-in-confidence Rejects when already-known()
  Exception independently-developed Overrides handed-over-in-confidence Rejects when developed()

// 3.2 Disclosure a court orders
Fact ordered Identified by recipient * item
Event court-order Related to recipient, item Creates ordered()
Fact notified Identified by recipient * discloser * item
Act notify-of-order Actor recipient Recipient discloser Related to item
  Holds when ordered()
  Creates notified()

// 2. Secrecy and use
Act disclose Actor recipient Related to discloser, item
  Holds when Not(confidential())
  Holds when ordered() && notified()
Act use Actor recipient Related to discloser, item, purpose
  Holds when Not(confidential()) || purpose == ConsideringTheVenture

// 5. Return
Power request-return Actor discloser Recipient recipient Related to item
  Holds when handed-over()
  Valid when handed-over()
Duty return-due Holder recipient Claimant discloser Related to item
  Due within 10
  Created by request-return
  Terminated by return-or-destroy
Act return-or-destroy Actor recipient Recipient discloser Related to item

Clause 1.1 Approved "100030edb58bdc476acb7f6ec1a1902996b5f1d677605d553147d06141e25413"
  Definition "Tidewater Robotics and Juniper Analytics are the parties."
  Norm " Each may disclose confidential information to the other while they consider a joint venture, which is the purpose of this agreement." => hand-over
Clause 1.2 Approved "7d6de387e752734b5a3a868ec906649ffe19f566d2b42322617e3d4cb817d01d"
  Norm "Confidential information is whatever a party marks as confidential when it hands it to the other." => hand-over
  Definition " The party handing it over is the discloser and the party receiving it is the recipient."
Clause 2.1 Approved "98d58bb73906dc217c0a9ef5ae88e631473d9bc2bda1ae521ef370f34eed1934"
  Norm "The recipient does not disclose the discloser's confidential information to anyone else." => disclose
Clause 2.2 Approved "094d75d34438b1109cc579aa0181e6cb76861684a7b927240875c21a469940b4"
  Norm "The recipient uses the discloser's confidential information only for the purpose." => use
Clause 3.1 Approved "ae7e1aa387afaa785dfc436a70187c12879ed5416353d579c7208dabd74140ca"
  Norm "Clauses 2.1 and 2.2 do not apply to information that is public, that the recipient already knew before it was handed over, or that the recipient developed independently." => disclose, use, hand-over
Clause 3.2 Approved "390573e3fbe119c79f9582bcdd084cc05914f6c36efced659c48001a321ee1f1"
  Norm "The recipient may disclose confidential information that a court orders it to disclose, but only after notifying the discloser of the order." => disclose, notify-of-order
Clause 4.1 Approved "42f7ebff097e8e7f3a6c3dfcdf3fa7589615f1a8c7a59af9ad941f368d2e2d39"
  Norm "Clauses 2.1 and 2.2 bind the recipient for three years from the day the information was handed over, and not after." => hand-over, disclose, use
Clause 5.1 Approved "65c2cec2542c13047878f10b85a4d2518e9aafc754c7af4154451d69fd30d745"
  Norm "The recipient returns or destroys the discloser's confidential information within ten days after the discloser asks for it." => request-return, return-due, return-or-destroy
.
